zeekrmate
Self-hosted data logger for the Zeekr 7X.

This program is a modified version of FordLogger.

  Original work: FordLogger, by lutzerb
  Source:        https://github.com/lutzerb/fordlogger
  Licence:       GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (AGPL-3.0)

Modification notice (AGPL-3.0, section 5(a)):

  Modified in 2026 by the zeekrmate contributors
  (https://github.com/johnsonjsyuen/zeekrmate):
  - Ford (FordConnect) support removed: OAuth/API client, token handling,
    Ford-specific configuration, tests and documentation.
  - Zeekr support added through a vehicle-provider boundary that uses the
    zeekr_ev_api library.
  - Grafana dashboards adapted for Zeekr and renamed to zeekrmate.
  - Deployment hardened (secrets from .env, no published database port,
    read-only Grafana database role, verified backup and restore).
  The upstream git history is retained in this repository.

